 ## Overview
-It is a learning rate schedule that transitions from an initial value to a final value using a cosine function to ease the change [S1, unofficial]. It differs from the parent [Linear Learning Rate Schedule](11850-linear-learning-rate-schedule.md) by providing a non-linear, smooth decay curve rather than a linear interpolation, which can help stabilize optimization in radiance-field training by reducing the learning rate more gradually in the later stages [S1, unofficial].
